sentences.text:
The petitioner has filed the present petition, inter alia, praying as under:
"i) Issue a writ of certiorari or any other appropriate writ, order or direction for calling the record in respect of the land comprising in Khasra no.7//4/2 (3-16) and 5 (4-16), situated in the revenue estate of village Barwala, Delhi, which was acquired vide Award No.12/2005-06/DC(NW) of village Barwala, Delhi, from the office of respondent;
ii) Issue a writ of mandamus or any other appropriate writ, order or direction for respondent to decide the application for payment dated 09.03.2017, in respect of the land comprising in Khasra No.7//4/2 (3-16) and 5 (4-16), situated in the revenue estate of village Barwala, Delhi.
